					<![CDATA[
						 <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Can someone please send me the exact coordinates so I can find it in Google map. I would love to freely roam around the foundation site in the comfort of my own home.</span></p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">I would very much appreciate it.</span></p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><em>Thanks</em></span></p> <p>Never mind I figured it out myself<br /> Coordinates: 39°04'21&quot;N 86°27'45&quot;W • 228&#160;m</p> 
				 	]]>
