					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A few minor questions, about making edits to this page.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-3740">SCP-3740</a> is listed as being contained in Site 81. If we find established SCPs contained at a site but unlisted on the Site's Dossier, can we add them to the list?</p> <p>Second of all, am I allowed to or can someone else organize the list of SCPs? As it is, they are almost but not quite numerically organized, and it makes finding SCPs on the list a little more confusing and hard.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
