					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1979024#post-2683092</guid>
				<title>Site Dossiers</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1979024/secure-facility-dossier:site-81#post-2683092</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 03 Nov 2016 03:24:04 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>djkaktus</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1888434</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>So this is a project that I've thought about for a long time, and with staff now looking at the Secure Facilities page, I thought this was as good a time as any to pull it back out of the bag and see what we could come up with.</p> <p>Since I write a <em>lot</em> about Site-81, here's where I started. Depending on interest, and what the staff project comes up with, we may try to do a few more of these. Who knows. Call it world-building.</p> <p>Anyway, hope you enjoy!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
